# Scratch notes. TEMPORARY/ is the working directory for session-specific
# staging notes - things that are true for one afternoon and misleading a week
# later. Keeping them out of the repository is deliberate: a future session
# reading stale notes as if they were documentation is worse than having none.
# Anything worth keeping graduates into docs/ and gets committed.
